\par }{\b\ul 
\par 1. Description
\par }{
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\ilvl12\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\i Compass}{ is a direction finding program. You tell the program where you are, and it displays a compass showing the current positions of the sun, moon and 3 bright stars 
(if they are above the horizon). So simply line up the Psion with the heavenly body and the compass shows you which direction is North.
\par 
\par You can also get }{\i Compass }{to show the direction of the shortest route to any other city, and even see the route on a world map!
\par 
\par This way you can for example find the direction for prayer towards Jerusalem or Mecca.
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par 
